\begin{tabular}{|l|l|l|l|} \hline \(p_{t}\) **range** & **Embedding Result** & **Pure Simulation Result** & **Difference** \\ \hline \(0.1\leq p_{t}<0.7\) GeV/c: & 0.1701 \(\pm\) 0.0021 & 0.1725 \(\pm\) 0.0018 & 1.40\% \\ \hline \(0.7\leq p_{t}<1.3\) GeV/c: & 0.1944 \(\pm\) 0.0016 & 0.1865 \(\pm\) 0.0020 & -4.03\% \\ \hline \(1.3\leq p_{t}<1.9\) GeV/c: & 0.2267 \(\pm\) 0.0022 & 0.2173 \(\pm\) 0.0022 & -4.13\% \\ \hline \end{tabular}
